## Sovereign by default

The HAL gateway on `:4010` routes **DeepSeek · Gemini · Groq · xAI** with **no Anthropic in the path**. Claude is right there the moment you want it — and a weekly cap on any single provider **never blocks you**. Your stack, your providers, your call.

