## Secrets never touch the file

Provider keys flow through **`bin/grip-keyring`** — never baked into this installer, never written to disk in the clear:

| Platform | Keystore |
|----------|----------|
| macOS    | Keychain |
| Linux    | secret-tool |
| Windows  | Credential Vault |

