## The witnessable node

When the install finishes it stands up a **happiverse** proof — open `apps/happiverse-proof/index.html` in any browser. No account, no sign-in.

> **Don't trust it — witness it.** Ed25519 signatures you verify yourself.

Read the invariants **honestly**:

- It is **movement-first** — not a uniqueness claim.
- It proves **one node's OWN signed chain** — *this* machine's record, checkable on the spot.
- It is **not** a connected network and **not** a Bitcoin anchor. Those are **ROADMAP**, not today. No overclaiming.

