## HAPPI 1.3

The open language, grown one auditable primitive at a time:

| Version  | Primitive | What it gives you |
|---------:|-----------|-------------------|
| **v1.1** | IDR | the audit primitive — tamper-evident decision records |
| **v1.2** | signed memory-chain | what was believed, and when — signed |
| **v1.3** | cite.verify | deterministic citation-provenance — claims you can re-check |

Together the three form **cryptographic causation**: *what* GRIP decided (IDR), *what* it believed when it decided (memory-chain), and every outward claim backed by deterministic provenance (cite.verify) — bound together, falsifiable by math, verifiable by anyone, never by self-assertion.

